### Requires the "REST Client" VS Code extension for the Send Request buttons.
### Backend: npm run dev; the API listens on http://localhost:3001

@host = http://localhost:3001

### Health check
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Menu products
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Create a NEW Bloom Rewards membership with an unpaid order
### Save the returned loyaltyCode for the next request.
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Demo Customer",
  "fulfillment": "takeaway",
  "paymentMethod": "counter",
  "joinRewards": true,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "mocha",
      "quantity": 1,
      "options": {
        "size": "medium",
        "milk": "regular",
        "syrup": "none",
        "sugar": 0,
        "extraShot": false
      }
    }
  ]
}

### Replace YOUR_CARD_CODE (20 hex characters) after first request
GET {{host}}/api/loyalty/accounts/YOUR_CARD_CODE

### Staff login (DEMO ONLY)
POST {{host}}/api/staff/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "manager",
  "pin": "123456"
}

### Add Authorization: Bearer <token> for manager summary request
GET {{host}}/api/loyalty/overview
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_STAFF_TOKEN

### NOTE: to mark paid, go to Kitchen and verify actual receipt of money.
### The kiosk does not charge card or send SMS messages.
